) mouse model is widely used to study atherosclerosis. ApoE
–/–
mice possess risk factors such as cerebral arteriosclerosis and lipometabolic disturbances. Blood-brain barrier disruptions and synaptic injury are among the pathological characteristics seen in this mouse model, as in VaD.
